{"ref":"BDB, מִצְפָּה","hw":"מִצְפָּה","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְפָּה</span></big><sub>38</sub>  <strong>n.pr.loc. (</strong>proposes <em>outlook-point</em> or <em>-height;</em> c. art. (except <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:1\" href=\"/Hosea.5.1\">Ho 5:1</a>)<strong>)</strong>;—<br>†<strong>1.</strong>  in Gilead, expl. as name given to Laban’s cairn, N. of Jabbok <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:49\" href=\"/Genesis.31.49\">Gn 31:49</a> (on text v. Ball Holz; 𝔊 ἡ ὅρασις).<br>†<strong>2.</strong>  prob. S. of Jabbok, <a data-ref=\"Judges 10:17\" href=\"/Judges.10.17\">Ju 10:17</a> (ἡ σκοπιά), <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:11\" href=\"/Judges.11.11\">11:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:34\" href=\"/Judges.11.34\">34</a> (Μασσηφα; so 𝔊L <a data-ref=\"Judges 10:17\" href=\"/Judges.10.17\">10:17</a>), <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:1\" href=\"/Hosea.5.1\">Ho 5:1</a> (ἡ σκοπιά); appar. = ii. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְפֶּה</span> <strong>3</strong>, Buhl<sup>Geogr. 262</sup> (<span dir=\"rtl\">-פֶּה</span>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">פָּה</span>, seem to interchange); site unknown; v. conj. in Buhl<sup>l.c.</sup>, cf. GASm<sup>Geogr. 586</sup>.<br>†<strong>3.</strong>  near Hermon, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:3\" href=\"/Joshua.11.3\">Jos 11:3</a>, Μασευμαν, Μασσηφα(θ), = <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּקְעַת־מִצְפֶּה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:8\" href=\"/Joshua.11.8\">8</a>, Μασσωχ, Μασσηφα; v. Buhl<sup>Geogr. 240</sup>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  old sacred place in Benj., Μασσηφα, etc.;—<span dir=\"rtl\">הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:1\" href=\"/Judges.20.1\">Ju 20:1</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמִּצְפָּ֫תָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 7:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.7.5\">1 S 7:5</a> +;—<a data-ref=\"Judges 20:1\" href=\"/Judges.20.1\">Ju 20:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:3\" href=\"/Judges.20.3\">3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:1\" href=\"/Judges.21.1\">21:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:5\" href=\"/Judges.21.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:8\" href=\"/Judges.21.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 7:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.7.5\">1 S 7:5</a> + 7 times <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.7\">1 S 7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:22\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.22\">1 K 15:22</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 16:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.16.6\">2 Ch 16:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.23\">2 K 25:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.6\">Je 40:6</a> + 12 times <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40\">40</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41\">41</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.7\">Ne 3:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.19\">19</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמִּצְפֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:26\" href=\"/Joshua.18.26\">Jos 18:26</a>;—mod. <em>Nabî Samwîn</em>, 5 miles NW. of Jerusalem, v. Buhl<sup>Geogr. 167 f.</sup>.","next":"BDB, צָפָה⁴","prev":"BDB, מִצְפֶּה³"}